flowchart LR
    R[Runtime v3\nredacted events] --> V[Vector\nbounded disk buffer]
    V -->|bounded batch and retry| S[(Private S3 log archive)]
    V --> T[Failure telemetry\nlocal and CloudWatch]
    TF[Terraform] --> S
    TF --> I[IAM publisher policy]
    I --> V
    S --> L[Encryption, versioning,\nretention lifecycle]
    X[S3 unavailable] -. archival degrades only .-> V
    R --> H[Runtime health and recovery]
    X -. no readiness dependency .-> H
